{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 推理与规划MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Tree-of-Thoughts (ToT) 树状推理\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"推理与规划\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/推理规划\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">推理与规划MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细解释 Tree-of-Thoughts (ToT) 的原理、核心工作流程，与 CoT 的对比，以及它在 Agent 推理中的适用场景和工程实现要点。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心原理</strong>：<br>\nTree-of-Thoughts (ToT) 是 CoT 的扩展和升级。CoT 是线性的单路径推理，而 ToT 将推理过程建模为树状搜索——在每一步都生成多个可能的思考（思维节点），然后通过评估和搜索算法选择最优路径。ToT 的核心思想是：复杂问题往往有多个可能的解决路径，需要像下棋一样探索多种可能性。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">ToT 的形式化表示：将问题解决视为在搜索树上的遍历，每个节点 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">s = [x, z₁...ᵢ]</code> 代表一个包含初始输入 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">x</code> 和一系列思考步骤的部分解。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心工作流程（四步循环）</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>思考分解（Decompose）</strong>：将问题分解为多个思维步骤，每个步骤是一个连贯的语言序列（如一个段落、一个方程式）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>思考生成（Generate）</strong>：在每个节点上，使用 LLM 生成 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">k</code> 个候选的下一步思考。可以通过采样或 proposal prompt 实现</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>状态评估（Evaluate）</strong>：使用 LLM 对每个候选节点进行评估打分，判断其前景。评估方式包括：独立评分（对每个节点单独打分）或相对投票（让 LLM 在候选中选择最好的）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>搜索算法（Search）</strong>：使用 BFS（广度优先搜索）或 DFS（深度优先搜索）在思维树上搜索最优路径。配合剪枝策略去除低质量分支</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>与 CoT 的对比</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>CoT</th>\n<th>ToT</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>结构</td>\n<td>线性链</td>\n<td>树状分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路径</td>\n<td>单一路径</td>\n<td>多路径并行探索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回溯能力</td>\n<td>无，一旦出错无法回头</td>\n<td>有，可以回溯到父节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评估</td>\n<td>无中间评估</td>\n<td>每步都有状态评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算成本</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（需多次 LLM 调用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用问题</td>\n<td>步骤明确的推理</td>\n<td>需要探索的开放问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>适用场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">数学证明和复杂计算（需要尝试多种方法）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">创意写作和头脑风暴（需要发散性思维）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">谜题和游戏（需要试错和评估）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">策略规划（需要前瞻和多步评估）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">代码生成（多种实现方案的选择）</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>工程实现要点</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">TreeOfThoughts</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> beam_width<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_depth<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>beam_width <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> beam_width  <span class=\"token comment\"># 每层的候选数</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_depth <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> max_depth    <span class=\"token comment\"># 最大搜索深度</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">generate_thoughts</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> k<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"生成 k 个候选下一步思考\"\"\"</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"基于当前状态: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n生成 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>k<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> 个不同的下一步思考:\"</span></span>\n        responses <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> n<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>k<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> temperature<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0.7</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>Thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>r<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> r <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> responses<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">evaluate_state</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"评估节点的价值（前景）\"\"\"</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"评估以下状态的前景(0-10): </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n        score <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> temperature<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>score<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">search</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> problem<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"BFS 搜索\"\"\"</span>\n        root <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>problem<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        beam <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>root<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> depth <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_depth<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            candidates <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> node <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> beam<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                thoughts <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate_thoughts<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>beam_width<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> thought <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> thoughts<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    child <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> parent<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                    child<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluate_state<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>child<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                    candidates<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>child<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 选择 top-k 候选进入下一层</span>\n            beam <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">sorted</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>candidates<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token keyword\">lambda</span> x<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> x<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reverse<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>beam_width<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> beam<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 返回最优路径</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 1</strong>：ToT 中 BFS 和 DFS 各适合什么场景？答：BFS 适合需要全局最优的问题，可以并行评估多个方向；DFS 适合路径深度有限的问题，内存占用更小。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 2</strong>：如何减少 ToT 的 LLM 调用次数？答：可以通过早期剪枝（剪掉明显低分的分支）、缓存评估结果、使用更小的模型做初步筛选等方式优化。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 3</strong>：ToT 和 MCTS 怎么结合？答：可以用 MCTS 的 UCT 公式指导搜索，平衡探索和利用。LATS (Language Agent Tree Search) 就是一个结合 MCTS 和 ReAct 的框架。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 1</strong>：所有复杂问题都应该用 ToT。实际上很多任务 CoT 已经足够，ToT 的高计算成本需要合理评估。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 2</strong>：忽视状态评估的重要性。ToT 的效果很大程度上依赖于评估函数的准确性。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 3</strong>：生成太多候选分支。候选数过多会导致搜索空间爆炸，一般 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">k=3-5</code> 即可。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关\" dir=\"auto\">相关</h2>","headings":[]}